fin-portfolio:DirectUnitValuationProfileShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "Direct Unit Valuation Profile, is the concrete valuation method profile that values a position by signed snapshot quantity multiplied by an exact direct-unit Money price, with contractMultiplier = 1 and forbidding par, accrued, inverse, notional, and multiplier fallback paths. This is where the previously global hard lock of directUnitPriceTimesQuantity lives; other ValuationMethodFamily profiles are not bound by these forbiddals.";
